      "summary": {
        "text": "Patrick Charles Staropoli (born November 10, 1989) is an American retina surgeon and professional stock car racing driver. He last competed full-time in the NASCAR O'Reilly Auto Parts Series, driving the No. 48 Chevrolet Camaro SS for Big Machine Racing, part-time in the ARCA Menards Series, driving the No. 51 Chevrolet SS for Rick Ware Racing, and part-time in the ARCA Menards Series West, driving the No. 20 Chevrolet SS for Bill McAnally Racing. He also previously competed in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series.",
